# Blinks: Xardas' face close up. Quiet, then he says a line (more blinks, in the pauses of the voice), the
# hero is put here and there round him (his eyes jump after him: a blink with some), a frightened face
# (more blinks), the eyes closed (none). With `blink off` on top of a copy: nobody blinks, as before.
cheat god
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest       # he leaves his bookstand and stands still
wait 500
place 150 0
cam face 36 15 1
wait 800
rec quiet
wait 20000
stop
speak nearest DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_14_00
rec speak
wait 9500
stop
rec look
place 150 50
wait 2500
place 150 -50
wait 2500
place 150 20
wait 2500
place 150 -30
wait 2500
place 150 0
wait 2500
stop
faceanim nearest S_FRIGHTENED 20000
wait 1500
rec afraid
wait 15000
stop
faceanim nearest S_EYESCLOSED 9000
wait 1500
rec closed
wait 6000
stop
